Package: shaprint
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ShaPrint Maintainers <maintainers@shaprint.local>
Depends: systemd, cups, adduser
Recommends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, polkitd | policykit-1, ufw | firewalld
Homepage: https://github.com/ardli-firman/sha-print
Description: ShaPrint print-sharing and client-proxy daemon
 ShaPrint shares printers over LAN and cross-VLAN using standard IPPS and
 multicast DNS discovery. This package installs the machine-wide shaprintd
 daemon, shaprintctl CLI, dedicated unprivileged shaprint account, and
 systemd service integration.
